  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntroPageData
  pageTitle: The Garbage Men
  pageBody: 'They were not heroes.


    They were workers, scavengers, and desperate
    people with nothing left to lose. The cities called them recovery teams.


    Everyone
    else called them Garbage Men.'
